OL,3,GNEWSAPlaid warned not to cut help for
OL,4,Apoorer children if it wants Labour to
OL,5,Aback budget
OL,6,
OL,7,FWelsh Labour has said it will not
OL,8,Fsupport the Welsh government's budget
OL,9,Fif cuts are made to a flagship early
OL,10,Fyears programme.
OL,12,FThe party's leader, Ken Skates, said
OL,13,Fthe future of the Flying Start scheme
OL,14,F"has to be a red line" in his party's
OL,15,Fongoing budget talks with the
OL,16,Fgovernment.
OL,18,FA Plaid Cymru government minister
OL,19,Fpraised aspects of the scheme but did
OL,20,Fnot say whether it would continue in
OL,21,Fits current form.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
